          "stageRecord": "Move Boken from the VP-complement position shown in the preceding workspace to Spec-IP, leaving an NP trace. This is passive A-movement: the landing site supplies no new theta-role, while the chain retains the Theme role assigned at its foot. Finite I licenses nominative Case on the raised NP, resolving the absence of accusative inside the passive VP and satisfying the clause's subject requirement. The raised NP c-commands its trace, and the participial V governs the object trace. The agent phrase remains inside VP and does not intervene in the movement dependency. The resulting IP already has the pronounced order Boken blev läst av Sara, but this analysis still requires the root V2 configuration.",
